You know Freddy Finkel.

1160
01:07:10.525 --> 01:07:11.636
- <i>Heil</i> Hitler.
- <i>Heil</i> Hitler.

1161
01:07:11.660 --> 01:07:12.703
- <i>Heil</i> Hitler.
- <i>Heil</i> Hitler.

1162
